{"ref":"BDB, בָּרָק²","hw":"בָּרָק²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בָּרָק</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>lightning-flash</em>, cf. Pun. <em>Barcas</em>, surname of Hamilear, cf. Nepos<sup>Hamilcar 1, 1</sup>; Sab. <span dir=\"rtl\">ברקם</span> DHM<sup>ZMG, 1875, 592</sup>; Palm. <span dir=\"rtl\">ברק</span> Vog<sup>Palm. 76</sup><strong>)</strong> son of Abinoam, & leader of Israel <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:6\" href=\"/Judges.4.6\">Ju 4:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:8\" href=\"/Judges.4.8\">8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:9\" href=\"/Judges.4.9\">9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:10\" href=\"/Judges.4.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:12\" href=\"/Judges.4.12\">12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:14\" href=\"/Judges.4.14\">14</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:15\" href=\"/Judges.4.15\">15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:16\" href=\"/Judges.4.16\">16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 4:22\" href=\"/Judges.4.22\">22</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:1\" href=\"/Judges.5.1\">5:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:12\" href=\"/Judges.5.12\">12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:15\" href=\"/Judges.5.15\">15</a>.","next":"BDB, בְּרַק","prev":"BDB, בָּרָק"}